      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b7b9c9e6369b9011",
      "translationZh": "为 LLM 网关添加了 x-claude-code-request-class、x-claude-code-agent-type、x-claude-code-prev-tool-durations、x-claude-code-compaction 和 x-claude-code-context-compacted 请求头；可通过 CLAUDE_CODE_GATEWAY_HINT_HEADERS=1 启用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0edd90f128b6979a",
      "translationZh": "当 MCP 服务器在会话中途断开且自动重连放弃时，添加了通知，指向 /mcp。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0fef648843446559",
      "translationZh": "添加了从 Claude 应用通过 claude --remote-control 或 /remote-control 启动的会话的分叉功能；该分叉在您的计算机上以后台会话运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "504f55071a98ba26",
      "translationZh": "修复了权限检查器无法完全分析的 Bash 命令，这些命令会在 permissions.blockReadsOutsideWorkingDirectories 下跳过提示；以及修复了旁路模式下隐藏危险 rm 命令的子 shell。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7be76ed6ff9ce54d",
      "translationZh": "修复了从 claude.ai 同步的技能在组织关闭 Skills 后仍然可用的问题；现在它们会移动到可恢复的回收站。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ed0920a151ae604",
      "translationZh": "修复了通过 MDM 或 managed-settings.json 设置的 allowManagedMcpServersOnly、deniedMcpServers 和 disableClaudeAiConnectors 在同时存在服务器托管设置时被忽略的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fbb4b2a24830a9a9",
      "translationZh": "修复了 Bedrock、Vertex 和 Foundry 上的 401/403 错误，以及 Claude 应用网关的 403 错误；之前会提示运行 /login，现在消息会指出需要刷新的凭据或指向您的网关管理员。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f93a8cdd9227bfca",
      "translationZh": "修复了 /login、/upgrade 和 /extra-usage 会丢弃对话中之前的思考，导致下一次请求强制完全重写 prompt 缓存的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1fae6e91e5cc9353",
      "translationZh": "修复了在云端或远程控制会话中，当 Artifact 工具上传您附加到聊天的文件时，自动模式因需要审批而停止的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3d861c1a13cf7d93",
      "translationZh": "修复了长时间运行的会话在仓库的 .git 目录被删除或移动后重新创建存根 .git/info/exclude 文件的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be94b34b3fe45d9c",
