      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "768c6a573620ec08",
      "translationZh": "修复了 macOS 上的 Read 在拖入截屏或系统报告为第二路径的任何文件时，因出现 \"symlink resolution changed after permission was checked\" 错误而拒绝读取的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
