      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "197b4cd756481215",
      "translationZh": "修复了 permissions.blockReadsOutsideWorkingDirectories：仓库设置中选择的内存目录不再被加载到提示中、被调用、索引或被内存提取使用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
