      "translationZh": "修复了在组织共享的私人 Slack 频道中设置的定时任务静默不发布的问题；现在这些任务会在它们创建的线程中继续运行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12ba08b093b10497",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 Claude 执行任务过程中，回复较旧的 Slack 线程时有时会从头重新启动，导致尚未推送的工作丢失的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d290a54355476488",
      "translationZh": "修复了在账户令牌刷新后不久，Claude 偶尔会丢弃一条带有错误 \"couldn't find a Claude Code environment\" 提示的消息。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44c0a76202df48ac",
      "translationZh": "修复了 AWS 连接拒绝无区域端点（如 Budgets、Savings Plans、WAF Classic 和 Import/Export）的问题；现在 Global Accelerator 请求会正确签名。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c3fa5e27221ce090",
      "translationZh": "改进了 AWS 连接失败的处理：当请求无法签名（例如主机名没有区域）时，Claude 会得到原因及修复方法，而不是仅得到一个裸错误。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7e7fa5def7805671",
      "translationZh": "修复了在提供程序返回小写令牌类型时，OAuth client-credentials 和 JWT-bearer 连接失败的问题；现在请求会发送标准的 Bearer 方案。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7945917d3415332d",
      "translationZh": "修复了在 Enterprise Grid 共享频道、Claude 尚未使用过的频道以及旧版私有频道上添加频道管理员被拒绝的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fc50413abc69548f",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 更改 Claude，使其自行开始观看相关的公共频道，例如对话依赖的事件频道，而不仅仅是在被请求时。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5b5a7a9d13853a4d",
      "translationZh": "[Claude Tag] 修复了 admin Memory 页面未列出 Claude 自行设置的 Slack 频道的问题，即使这些频道有已保存的内存；管理员现在可以打开、编辑和删除该内存。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fdabfb2873a3812e",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 修复了将基础分支合并到 PR 时，如果早期审查列出了 \"Additional findings\" 就会触发完整重新审查的问题；这些推送现在会获得较轻的后续审查。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "508e0335d31dc009",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 修复了由于 @-mention、跨行的代码 span 或带反引号的 HTML 标签而导致整个 REVIEW.md 被忽略的问题；仅与更改文件相关的行会被保留。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d23f827bb60df020",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 改进了建议的修复，以说明当其他代码依赖于被更改的行为时，修复必须保持什么功能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2183ab73d96e2e30",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 改进了指向第二个受影响位置的审查注释，以完整句子说明该位置的问题，而不是截断的 stub。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "926a442313fedf7a",
      "translationZh": "[Code Review] 修复了 /ultrareview --post，使得在 GitHub 错误后重试时，发现的评论会恰好发布一次，而不是从不发布或发布两次；该评论现在会命名所审查的提交。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
